Then ask Zhang

576
00:26:50,070 --> 00:26:51,870
if he's willing to let me use him.

577
00:26:52,790 --> 00:26:53,920
We can't have paid

578
00:26:54,480 --> 00:26:55,940
40% of the fee for nothing.

579
00:26:57,000 --> 00:26:58,110
How noble of you.

580
00:26:58,790 --> 00:27:00,050
You didn't spend a cent

581
00:27:00,310 --> 00:27:02,000
and all the credit goes to you.

582
00:27:03,240 --> 00:27:04,350
And now you're standing here

583
00:27:04,350 --> 00:27:05,240
to lecture me.

584
00:27:08,240 --> 00:27:10,900
Do you think I don't know
what you're getting at?

585
00:27:11,110 --> 00:27:12,710
Don't you just want to tell me

586
00:27:14,720 --> 00:27:15,640
that you want to leave?

587
00:27:15,640 --> 00:27:16,270
Right?

588
00:27:16,270 --> 00:27:16,920
Yes.

589
00:27:31,240 --> 00:27:32,000
Is there any chance
you'll change your mind?

590
00:27:32,000 --> 00:27:32,720
No.

591
00:27:46,960 --> 00:27:49,110
If you want to leave, no one can stop you.

592
00:27:49,110 --> 00:27:50,910
Come see me tomorrow afternoon.

593
00:27:51,400 --> 00:27:53,200
I'll process your resignation.

594
00:27:53,240 --> 00:27:53,960
Okay.

595
00:27:59,790 --> 00:28:00,550
Thank you.

596
00:28:01,960 --> 00:28:03,480
Thank you for your help

597
00:28:03,790 --> 00:28:05,190
over the past few months.

598
00:28:17,580 --> 00:28:22,770
[President's Office]

599
00:28:36,350 --> 00:28:37,200
Secretary Lu,

600
00:28:37,400 --> 00:28:38,960
notify President Liu
and Chief Physician Tong

601
00:28:38,960 --> 00:28:40,000
to come to my office for a meeting.

602
00:28:40,000 --> 00:28:40,790
Also,

603
00:28:41,160 --> 00:28:42,590
bring in the administration office's

604
00:28:42,590 --> 00:28:43,920
best problem-solvers,

605
00:28:44,030 --> 00:28:46,230
I want to hold a brainstorming session.

606
00:28:46,730 --> 00:28:47,760
I think

607
00:28:48,070 --> 00:28:49,720
we should go by the contract.

608
00:28:50,440 --> 00:28:51,440
Isn't he poor?

609
00:28:51,750 --> 00:28:53,070
Fine. He can leave.

610
00:28:53,070 --> 00:28:54,800
But he has to pay compensation.

611
00:28:54,960 --> 00:28:55,920
That won't work.

612
00:28:56,680 --> 00:28:57,720
I've already tried that.

613
00:28:57,720 --> 00:28:58,440
And I promised him

614
00:28:58,440 --> 00:28:59,160
I wouldn't use it again.

615
00:28:59,160 --> 00:28:59,550
President.

616
00:28:59,550 --> 00:29:01,440
Which matters more to you,
keeping him or saving face?

617
00:29:01,440 --> 00:29:02,160
Keeping him, of course.

618
00:29:02,160 --> 00:29:02,920
What's the point of saving face?

619
00:29:02,920 --> 00:29:03,920
Can I have both?

620
00:29:03,920 --> 00:29:05,440
If tough tactics don't work,
try a softer approach.

621
00:29:05,440 --> 00:29:06,880
Just give him an apartment.

622
00:29:06,880 --> 00:29:09,110
The apartments near our hospital...

623
00:29:10,070 --> 00:29:11,480
they cost over
1,000 yuan per square meter, right?

624
00:29:11,480 --> 00:29:12,550
A two-bedroom place

625
00:29:12,550 --> 00:29:14,480
would cost over 100,000 yuan, right?

626
00:29:14,480 --> 00:29:15,440
That much money wouldn't

627
00:29:15,440 --> 00:29:16,750
even buy you one square meter in Shenzhen.

628
00:29:16,750 --> 00:29:17,790
He wouldn't even care.

629
00:29:17,790 --> 00:29:18,720
Then what do we do?

630
00:29:18,720 --> 00:29:19,590
If neither approach works,

631
00:29:19,590 --> 00:29:20,310
we've got nothing
but this bond between us.

632
00:29:20,310 --> 00:29:21,640
That won't work either.

633
00:29:22,880 --> 00:29:24,830
I thought if he stayed at our hospital

634
00:29:24,830 --> 00:29:25,680
long enough,

635
00:29:25,680 --> 00:29:27,340
he'd build a real bond with us.

636
00:29:27,350 --> 00:29:28,000
But...

637
00:29:28,000 --> 00:29:28,440
this guy...

638
00:29:28,440 --> 00:29:29,880
seems like he's missing a screw.

639
00:29:29,880 --> 00:29:30,550
I mean...

640
00:29:30,550 --> 00:29:31,750
Trying to appeal to him emotionally

641
00:29:31,750 --> 00:29:34,920
is a total waste of time.

642
00:29:35,720 --> 00:29:36,590
Not necessarily.

643
00:29:36,590 --> 00:29:37,880
When it comes to social conventions,

644
00:29:37,880 --> 00:29:39,000
some people just don't understand them,

645
00:29:39,000 --> 00:29:40,550
while others simply don't want to.

646
00:29:40,550 --> 00:29:41,030
So tell me,

647
00:29:41,030 --> 00:29:42,160
which kind do you think

648
00:29:42,160 --> 00:29:43,240
a smart guy like Liu Zhengliang is?

649
00:29:43,240 --> 00:29:44,300
The stubborn kind.

650
00:29:45,480 --> 00:29:46,270
I think

651
00:29:46,270 --> 00:29:47,510
we should try appealing to his feelings.

652
00:29:47,510 --> 00:29:48,960
No, that won't work.

653
00:29:48,960 --> 00:29:49,640
-He has no feelings.
-Well,

654
00:29:49,640 --> 00:29:51,310
I don't mean our relationship with him.

655
00:29:51,310 --> 00:29:53,030
I'm saying we should
set him up with a woman

656
00:29:53,030 --> 00:29:53,880
and get him to fall in love.

657
00:29:53,880 --> 00:29:54,920
If he gets married, he'll stay.

658
00:29:54,920 --> 00:29:56,440
-How do you know...
-Hey, listen.

659
00:29:56,440 --> 00:29:57,680
Seriously, he's a professional doctor.

660
00:29:57,680 --> 00:29:58,550
If we're talking about skills,

661
00:29:58,550 --> 00:29:59,920
we need to weigh our options.

662
00:29:59,920 --> 00:30:01,440
Does our hospital

663
00:30:01,440 --> 00:30:02,160
need a skilled doctor,

664
00:30:02,160 --> 00:30:02,960
or someone

665
00:30:02,960 --> 00:30:04,240
as loyal as I am?

666
00:30:04,790 --> 00:30:06,110
Between loyalty and ability,

667
00:30:06,110 --> 00:30:07,480
which is more valuable?

668
00:30:07,480 --> 00:30:08,160
The president means...

669
00:30:08,160 --> 00:30:09,420
We need him to be loyal.

670
00:30:09,880 --> 00:30:11,410
Loyal? Who? The president?

671
00:30:14,780 --> 00:30:16,820
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

672
00:30:19,000 --> 00:30:19,790
Jiao.

673
00:30:22,030 --> 00:30:22,680
Come on.

674
00:30:23,030 --> 00:30:24,930
Let me examine you.

675
00:30:25,590 --> 00:30:26,790
Squeeze my hand.

676
00:30:32,880 --> 00:30:33,680
Harder.

677
00:30:35,350 --> 00:30:36,160
Very good.

678
00:30:36,680 --> 00:30:37,510
Slowly.

679
00:30:38,750 --> 00:30:40,440
Now the other hand. Here.

680
00:30:42,270 --> 00:30:43,070
Squeeze.

681
00:30:46,350 --> 00:30:47,240
Well done.

682
00:30:49,550 --> 00:30:51,350
Any problems with the feeding tube?

683
00:30:51,350 --> 00:30:52,480
No problems with it.

684
00:30:52,790 --> 00:30:54,440
Talk to her more often

685
00:30:55,160 --> 00:30:57,360
to help her regain her ability to speak.

686
00:30:58,160 --> 00:31:00,220
Physical therapy is important, too.

687
00:31:01,070 --> 00:31:03,330
It can reduce the risk of complications.

688
00:31:03,880 --> 00:31:05,270
When you have time,

689
00:31:05,480 --> 00:31:06,200
you can take her out

690
00:31:06,200 --> 00:31:08,260
in her wheelchair for some fresh air,

691
00:31:08,680 --> 00:31:10,160
but not for too long.

692
00:31:10,160 --> 00:31:10,880
Okay.

693
00:31:11,400 --> 00:31:13,400
Jiao is making a very good recovery.

694
00:31:13,720 --> 00:31:14,440
If you have any

695
00:31:14,440 --> 00:31:15,550
further questions,

696
00:31:15,550 --> 00:31:17,160
you can speak to Dr. Che.

697
00:31:18,960 --> 00:31:19,720
Dr. Liu.

698
00:31:21,270 --> 00:31:22,070
Well,

699
00:31:22,510 --> 00:31:23,840
I heard you're leaving.

700
00:31:25,270 --> 00:31:26,470
It's a work transfer.

701
00:31:27,110 --> 00:31:28,880
I, Zhang Dexu, am not good with words.

702
00:31:28,880 --> 00:31:30,310
How about I treat you to a meal?

703
00:31:30,310 --> 00:31:31,110
Please don't.

704
00:31:31,440 --> 00:31:33,240
I'm allergic to people

705
00:31:33,310 --> 00:31:34,240
buying me meals.

706
00:31:50,590 --> 00:31:52,520
Are you actually going to cure me or not?

707
00:31:52,520 --> 00:31:53,640
One minute you're checking this,

708
00:31:53,640 --> 00:31:54,590
the next you're checking something else.

709
00:31:54,590 --> 00:31:55,880
It never ends!

710
00:31:57,160 --> 00:31:58,490
I want to be discharged.

711
00:31:59,550 --> 00:32:01,550
We're doing thorough tests for you.

712
00:32:02,590 --> 00:32:04,070
Didn't you say you wanted to see

713
00:32:04,070 --> 00:32:05,480
if we could cure you?

714
00:32:05,480 --> 00:32:06,720
Then you have to give us some time.

715
00:32:06,720 --> 00:32:07,640
Why are you trying to leave again?

716
00:32:07,640 --> 00:32:09,240
Why are you throwing my own words

717
00:32:09,240 --> 00:32:10,310
back at me?

718
00:32:10,760 --> 00:32:12,320
I don't have time for that.

719
00:32:12,880 --> 00:32:13,590
Just now,

720
00:32:13,590 --> 00:32:15,880
I read my own fortune.

721
00:32:16,590 --> 00:32:18,480
It says a windfall is coming to my family.

722
00:32:18,480 --> 00:32:19,310
So

723
00:32:19,440 --> 00:32:21,040
I need to get back right away.

724
00:32:21,310 --> 00:32:22,350
Dad, if fortune-telling actually worked,

725
00:32:22,350 --> 00:32:23,950
we'd have been rich ages ago.

726
00:32:24,000 --> 00:32:24,960
Even if you get rich,

727
00:32:24,960 --> 00:32:26,890
isn't your health more important?

728
00:32:27,830 --> 00:32:29,160
Money can buy you good health.

729
00:32:29,160 --> 00:32:30,640
Look at all those rich people,

730
00:32:30,640 --> 00:32:31,550
the millionaires.

731
00:32:31,550 --> 00:32:32,200
Every one of them

732
00:32:32,200 --> 00:32:33,790
seems to live longer than everyone else.

733
00:32:33,790 --> 00:32:35,510
Isn't that because they're rich?

734
00:32:35,510 --> 00:32:37,440
So you do believe in medicine.

735
00:32:37,960 --> 00:32:39,550
You just don't believe in us.

736
00:32:39,550 --> 00:32:40,310
Right!

737
00:32:40,480 --> 00:32:42,480
Before I came here, I believed in you.

738
00:32:42,480 --> 00:32:43,400
But since I got here,

739
00:32:43,400 --> 00:32:44,160
it's been one test after another,

740
00:32:44,160 --> 00:32:45,000
day after day,

741
00:32:45,000 --> 00:32:46,720
and you still haven't made a diagnosis.

742
00:32:46,720 --> 00:32:48,680
How am I supposed to trust you?

743
00:32:49,410 --> 00:32:50,310
Dad, they still need to run

744
00:32:50,310 --> 00:32:51,550
a few more tests.

745
00:32:51,830 --> 00:32:53,560
What's the point of doing that?

746
00:32:53,720 --> 00:32:55,310
Life and death are in the hands of fate;
wealth and honor are in the hands of God.

747
00:32:55,310 --> 00:32:57,070
Let's go home.

748
00:32:57,680 --> 00:32:58,680
No, Mr. Wang.

749
00:32:58,680 --> 00:33:00,550
-How about you read my fortune?
-Hey, Mr. Wang.

750
00:33:00,550 --> 00:33:01,400
How about you read my fortune?

751
00:33:01,400 --> 00:33:02,030
Slow down. Slow down.

752
00:33:02,030 --> 00:33:03,310
-What can I do if I don't become a doctor?
-Listen to me.

753
00:33:02,680 --> 00:33:05,990
[Building a clean
and honest medical environment]

754
00:33:03,310 --> 00:33:03,750
Mr. Wang!

755
00:33:03,750 --> 00:33:05,030
Listen... listen to me,

756
00:33:05,030 --> 00:33:05,830
if you leave,

757
00:33:05,830 --> 00:33:06,920
you will be in great danger.

758
00:33:06,020 --> 00:33:11,570
[Code of Conduct
for Xiaoximen Hospital's Medical Staff]

759
00:33:06,920 --> 00:33:08,110
If your condition progresses,

760
00:33:08,110 --> 00:33:09,160
it could get really bad.

761
00:33:09,160 --> 00:33:09,720
How about this?

762
00:33:09,720 --> 00:33:10,680
If you don't trust us,

763
00:33:10,680 --> 00:33:11,960
I'll contact No. 1 Hospital for you.

764
00:33:11,960 --> 00:33:12,960
Once I know you've been admitted there,

765
00:33:12,960 --> 00:33:14,560
then I'll let you leave here.

766
00:33:14,880 --> 00:33:16,030
Is this a hospital

767
00:33:16,640 --> 00:33:18,030
or a bandits' hideout?

768
00:33:18,270 --> 00:33:20,000
Why can't I just leave?

769
00:33:20,000 --> 00:33:20,510
That's not what I meant.

770
00:33:20,510 --> 00:33:21,110
Mr. Wang.

771
00:33:21,110 --> 00:33:21,960
Don't pull me!

772
00:33:22,750 --> 00:33:23,550
President.

773
00:33:26,350 --> 00:33:27,410
Do you remember me?

774
00:33:28,070 --> 00:33:29,600
You look a little familiar.

775
00:33:29,680 --> 00:33:32,480
We played chess at the park
by the railway station.

776
00:33:32,640 --> 00:33:34,440
That's why you seemed familiar.

777
00:33:36,160 --> 00:33:37,030
Bro.

778
00:33:38,030 --> 00:33:39,310
I've learned a little

779
00:33:39,510 --> 00:33:41,240
about your condition.

780
00:33:41,920 --> 00:33:43,580
It is indeed hard to diagnose.

781
00:33:44,510 --> 00:33:46,270
Medical science today

782
00:33:46,270 --> 00:33:47,400
is not omnipotent,

783
00:33:47,400 --> 00:33:48,160
you know?

784
00:33:49,590 --> 00:33:50,790
See? That's more like it.

785
00:33:50,790 --> 00:33:52,050
It's pleasant to hear.

786
00:33:52,310 --> 00:33:53,570
That's our President.

787
00:33:55,480 --> 00:33:56,680
You're pretty impressive yourself.

788
00:33:56,680 --> 00:33:57,480
You seem like

789
00:33:57,480 --> 00:33:59,340
a well-read, knowledgeable man.

790
00:33:59,550 --> 00:34:01,070
If your daughter hadn't brought you here,

791
00:34:01,070 --> 00:34:02,270
you'd probably have tried a few

792
00:34:02,270 --> 00:34:03,960
folk remedies at home, right?

793
00:34:04,240 --> 00:34:04,960
Right.

794
00:34:05,310 --> 00:34:05,880
Bro,

795
00:34:05,880 --> 00:34:07,070
I'm not bragging.

796
00:34:07,310 --> 00:34:10,110
I have a complete guide to folk remedies,

797
00:34:10,110 --> 00:34:11,630
and it's actually handwritten.

798
00:34:11,630 --> 00:34:13,760
That's been passed down in the Wang family

799
00:34:13,760 --> 00:34:15,960
generation after generation.

800
00:34:16,070 --> 00:34:17,280
If we can figure it out,

801
00:34:17,280 --> 00:34:19,920
we could treat illnesses
just as well as they do.

802
00:34:19,920 --> 00:34:21,320
You're quite something.

803
00:34:22,360 --> 00:34:24,360
Then I'll cut straight to the chase.

804
00:34:25,150 --> 00:34:26,280
Think carefully.

805
00:34:27,960 --> 00:34:28,800
Have you used

806
00:34:28,800 --> 00:34:29,670
any folk remedies

807
00:34:29,670 --> 00:34:30,880
on yourself?

808
00:34:32,960 --> 00:34:33,960
Yes.

809
00:34:35,030 --> 00:34:35,840
Right.

810
00:34:35,840 --> 00:34:37,920
I had scabies a while ago,

811
00:34:38,670 --> 00:34:39,360
so I bought

812
00:34:39,360 --> 00:34:40,670
a pig's tail.

813
00:34:40,670 --> 00:34:42,110
I ate half of it raw

814
00:34:42,110 --> 00:34:42,880
and put the other half

815
00:34:42,880 --> 00:34:44,550
on the wounds.

816
00:34:45,360 --> 00:34:47,000
A few days later,

817
00:34:47,550 --> 00:34:48,880
the scabies cleared up.

818
00:34:49,320 --> 00:34:50,580
Parasitic infection!

819
00:34:50,880 --> 00:34:52,610
Why didn't you tell us earlier?

820
00:34:53,400 --> 00:34:54,860
I'll leave the rest to you.

821
00:34:54,880 --> 00:34:57,070
I'll arrange
the corresponding tests immediately.

822
00:34:57,070 --> 00:34:58,200
Hold on, more tests?

823
00:34:58,320 --> 00:34:59,760
What's the point of this?

824
00:34:59,760 --> 00:35:00,630
One test

825
00:35:00,630 --> 00:35:01,070
after another.

826
00:35:01,070 --> 00:35:03,400
-This is never going to end, is it?
-No, this time is different.

827
00:35:03,400 --> 00:35:04,860
-Wang! Wang!
-Infection!

828
00:35:04,920 --> 00:35:05,710
Listen to me.

829
00:35:05,840 --> 00:35:07,700
Let's have a quick word over here.

830
00:35:13,340 --> 00:35:18,870
[Priority for Stroke Patients]
[Chest Pain is Preferenced]

831
00:35:19,320 --> 00:35:20,070
Sure, bro.

832
00:35:24,550 --> 00:35:26,080
President Long called me over.

833
00:35:26,080 --> 00:35:27,890
I completely agree now.

834
00:35:28,880 --> 00:35:30,480
Run whatever tests you want.

835
00:35:30,840 --> 00:35:31,550
All right?

836
00:35:31,550 --> 00:35:32,680
-Okay, okay.
-Good.

837
00:35:38,140 --> 00:35:40,750
[Fujian Kangtaierke Hospital
Invitation Letter]

838
00:35:39,280 --> 00:35:41,810
This is a privately owned
hospital in Fujian.

839
00:35:42,480 --> 00:35:44,410
President Hong is a friend of mine.

840
00:35:45,510 --> 00:35:47,550
I've sent him your profile,

841
00:35:47,880 --> 00:35:49,670
and he's very interested in you.

842
00:35:49,670 --> 00:35:51,920
So he sent these introduction brochures

843
00:35:51,920 --> 00:35:54,050
and invited you to visit the hospital.

844
00:35:54,320 --> 00:35:55,580
If you're interested,

845
00:35:56,030 --> 00:35:57,030
go check it out

846
00:35:57,680 --> 00:35:59,210
and see what he has to offer.

847
00:36:00,110 --> 00:36:01,590
It might be a good option.

848
00:36:03,960 --> 00:36:04,590
Okay.

849
00:36:13,360 --> 00:36:15,150
This is a personal connection

850
00:36:15,150 --> 00:36:16,810
I've been building for years.

851
00:36:18,110 --> 00:36:20,310
I've never called in this favor before.

852
00:36:20,320 --> 00:36:21,670
This is the first time.

853
00:36:25,800 --> 00:36:27,070
Don't feel pressured.

854
00:36:27,590 --> 00:36:30,230
Don't feel like you owe me a big favor.

855
00:36:31,710 --> 00:36:33,150
I-I won't.

856
00:36:39,030 --> 00:36:40,630
I've always seen it as my duty

857
00:36:41,590 --> 00:36:43,840
to help younger colleagues get ahead.

858
00:36:46,000 --> 00:36:46,760
Solving problems

859
00:36:46,760 --> 00:36:48,760
for your younger brother's surgery

860
00:36:49,630 --> 00:36:51,690
and giving you a promotion and a raise

861
00:36:52,280 --> 00:36:54,680
were all because I appreciate your talent.

862
00:36:55,150 --> 00:36:55,960
I know.

863
00:36:57,670 --> 00:36:59,030
When you leave,

864
00:37:00,110 --> 00:37:01,280
if anyone dares to call you

865
00:37:01,280 --> 00:37:02,190
ungrateful,

866
00:37:02,190 --> 00:37:03,320
you must let me know.

867
00:37:03,630 --> 00:37:05,510
I'll beat the heck out of them.

868
00:37:06,550 --> 00:37:07,950
There's no need for that.

869
00:37:08,070 --> 00:37:08,960
Anyway, I'm not planning to come back

870
00:37:08,960 --> 00:37:10,220
once I leave this time.

871
00:37:10,440 --> 00:37:11,510
I don't care

872
00:37:11,880 --> 00:37:12,840
what they say.

873
00:37:22,400 --> 00:37:23,840
It's a shame, really.

874
00:37:24,320 --> 00:37:25,590
If you could stay,

875
00:37:25,590 --> 00:37:26,710
in three years, you could be in

876
00:37:26,710 --> 00:37:28,000
Chief Physician Tong's position,

877
00:37:28,000 --> 00:37:29,510
and take over from me by the age of 40.

878
00:37:29,510 --> 00:37:30,710
How did you know that?

879
00:37:33,960 --> 00:37:35,070
That patient's case

880
00:37:35,070 --> 00:37:36,280
is quite unusual.

881
00:37:36,920 --> 00:37:37,840
How did you know

882
00:37:37,840 --> 00:37:39,300
he had tried a folk remedy?

883
00:37:43,070 --> 00:37:44,200
Do you want to learn?

884
00:37:45,590 --> 00:37:46,920
Stay and I'll teach you.

885
00:37:50,030 --> 00:37:52,230
I'll go arrange the patient's surgery.

886
00:38:01,760 --> 00:38:03,320
What's your name, sir?

887
00:38:04,230 --> 00:38:05,550
Wang Zongqi.

888
00:38:05,630 --> 00:38:07,690
We're about to
put you under general anesthesia.

889
00:38:07,690 --> 00:38:08,940
Take a deep breath.

890
00:38:09,400 --> 00:38:10,360
Breathe in.

891
00:38:11,190 --> 00:38:12,110
Breathe in.

892
00:38:12,880 --> 00:38:14,280
Take a deep breath again.

893
00:38:20,070 --> 00:38:21,480
Tell me, how did the president

894
00:38:21,480 --> 00:38:23,210
know he had tried a folk remedy?

895
00:38:26,440 --> 00:38:27,480
How would I know?

896
00:38:27,840 --> 00:38:28,710
You've followed him for so long,

897
00:38:28,710 --> 00:38:30,110
and you still don't know?

898
00:38:31,230 --> 00:38:33,000
Long really knows his stuff.

899
00:38:35,510 --> 00:38:36,440
Do you think

900
00:38:36,440 --> 00:38:38,030
he actually knows this patient?

901
00:38:38,030 --> 00:38:39,630
How about I ask the anesthesiologist
to wake him up,

902
00:38:39,630 --> 00:38:40,760
so you can ask him yourself?

903
00:38:40,760 --> 00:38:41,560
What's wrong?

904
00:38:41,840 --> 00:38:43,100
None of your business.

905
00:38:44,760 --> 00:38:45,840
Have you noticed

906
00:38:46,070 --> 00:38:47,130
the way you talk now

907
00:38:47,510 --> 00:38:49,230
is getting more and more northeastern?

908
00:38:49,230 --> 00:38:50,030
No, I'm not.

909
00:38:50,030 --> 00:38:51,230
Don't make things up.

910
00:38:51,670 --> 00:38:52,630
Chief Physician Liu is

911
00:38:52,630 --> 00:38:54,160
getting funnier by the day.

912
00:38:54,480 --> 00:38:56,010
I'm not funny. Give me that.

913
00:38:58,110 --> 00:38:59,230
What are you laughing at?

914
00:38:59,230 --> 00:39:00,190
Nothing, nothing.

915
00:39:00,190 --> 00:39:01,630
You're not funny at all.

916
00:39:01,960 --> 00:39:03,690
Round needle, size one suture.

917
00:39:04,000 --> 00:39:05,630
All right, focus.

918
00:39:05,880 --> 00:39:06,880
We're operating.

919
00:39:12,510 --> 00:39:14,710
Your technique is getting steadier.

920
00:39:14,840 --> 00:39:15,480
Scissors.

921
00:39:15,760 --> 00:39:17,890
That's because I have a great teacher.

922
00:39:18,190 --> 00:39:18,670
At the very least,

923
00:39:18,670 --> 00:39:20,130
we need to get in sync here.

924
00:39:20,160 --> 00:39:21,840
But this is Chief Physician Liu's

925
00:39:21,840 --> 00:39:23,500
last surgery at our hospital.

926
00:39:34,440 --> 00:39:35,800
Family of Wang Zongqi?

927
00:39:41,190 --> 00:39:42,650
The surgery was a success.

928
00:39:42,670 --> 00:39:43,760
This is what we removed

929
00:39:43,760 --> 00:39:44,440
from your father's head.

930
00:39:44,440 --> 00:39:45,250
Take a look.

931
00:39:49,030 --> 00:39:50,440
He's out of danger.

932
00:39:53,880 --> 00:39:55,320
Hello, Dr. Liu.

933
00:39:54,580 --> 00:39:57,690
[No smoking]

934
00:39:57,550 --> 00:39:58,680
Were you calling me?

935
00:39:58,760 --> 00:40:00,360
Yes, I was calling you.

936
00:40:00,360 --> 00:40:01,110
Come here.

937
00:40:01,670 --> 00:40:02,480
Sit with me for a while.

938
00:40:02,480 --> 00:40:03,340
Sit for a while.

939
00:40:04,110 --> 00:40:05,440
I don't think I know you.

940
00:40:06,360 --> 00:40:07,590
You don't know me,

941
00:40:07,710 --> 00:40:08,800
but I know you.

942
00:40:11,440 --> 00:40:12,230
That's true.

943
00:40:12,760 --> 00:40:14,820
With my big photo hanging on the wall,

944
00:40:15,030 --> 00:40:16,830
who around here doesn't know me?

945
00:40:17,150 --> 00:40:18,510
Yes, that's right.

946
00:40:18,800 --> 00:40:19,670
Dr. Liu,

947
00:40:21,000 --> 00:40:21,800
you know what?

948
00:40:22,070 --> 00:40:23,360
You strike me

949
00:40:24,070 --> 00:40:26,000
as a broken person.

950
00:40:26,480 --> 00:40:28,150
And then you were

951
00:40:28,230 --> 00:40:29,550
pieced back together,

952
00:40:29,550 --> 00:40:31,590
then covered with a layer of glue,

953
00:40:31,590 --> 00:40:33,630
forming a kind of shell.

954
00:40:34,280 --> 00:40:35,400
The last person

955
00:40:35,400 --> 00:40:36,800
who gave me that impression

956
00:40:36,800 --> 00:40:38,480
was President Long.

957
00:40:43,110 --> 00:40:44,840
[Liu Zhengliang]

958
00:40:43,630 --> 00:40:45,360
Do you know Long Dongdong well?

959
00:40:45,710 --> 00:40:46,920
I've been working at Xiaoximen Hospital

960
00:40:46,920 --> 00:40:48,280
for 35 years.

961
00:40:48,280 --> 00:40:49,880
Trust me, I know everybody.

962
00:40:52,920 --> 00:40:53,710
Dr. Liu...

963
00:40:54,450 --> 00:40:55,070
Dr. Liu?

964
00:40:55,070 --> 00:40:56,150
Don't you want to know how Long Dongdong

965
00:40:56,150 --> 00:40:57,380
figured out that your patient

966
00:40:57,380 --> 00:40:58,500
used a folk remedy?

967
00:41:01,390 --> 00:41:03,690
[Doctor White coat Place]

968
00:41:02,590 --> 00:41:03,840
How did you know about that?

969
00:41:03,840 --> 00:41:04,920
First, tell me

970
00:41:04,920 --> 00:41:06,320
if you want to know or not.

971
00:41:06,350 --> 00:41:08,530
[Doctor's White Coat Hooks]

972
00:41:07,400 --> 00:41:08,070
Yes.

973
00:41:11,440 --> 00:41:12,440
Here's the thing.

974
00:41:13,030 --> 00:41:13,800
You see,

975
00:41:13,920 --> 00:41:14,550
you work at

976
00:41:14,550 --> 00:41:16,360
a big hospital in the South.

977
00:41:16,880 --> 00:41:18,760
Your patients

978
00:41:18,760 --> 00:41:19,710
all come from

979
00:41:19,710 --> 00:41:20,920
your region

980
00:41:20,920 --> 00:41:22,840
and the surrounding area;

981
00:41:23,000 --> 00:41:25,510
those are the people
who come to you for treatment.

982
00:41:25,510 --> 00:41:27,360
But the people

983
00:41:27,480 --> 00:41:28,320
Xiaoximen Hospital serves

984
00:41:28,320 --> 00:41:29,880
are... are different.

985
00:41:29,880 --> 00:41:31,630
It faces...

986
00:41:32,960 --> 00:41:34,110
I mean, it...

987
00:41:35,550 --> 00:41:37,030
it caters to...

988
00:41:39,710 --> 00:41:40,630
I-it...

989
00:41:41,590 --> 00:41:43,190
it serves...

990
00:41:43,510 --> 00:41:44,440
well...

991
00:41:45,400 --> 00:41:46,190
it serves...

992
00:41:47,620 --> 00:41:55,750
[Buffer Room to Staff Quarters]

993
00:41:49,550 --> 00:41:50,320
Wait, wait, wait.

994
00:41:50,320 --> 00:41:52,360
Your handwriting is too small.

995
00:41:52,880 --> 00:41:53,940
Can you make it out?

996
00:41:54,070 --> 00:41:54,670
Well, um...

997
00:41:54,670 --> 00:41:55,550
Hold on, where were you?

998
00:41:55,550 --> 00:41:56,280
Let me see.

999
00:41:56,590 --> 00:41:57,400
Here.

1000
00:41:57,670 --> 00:41:58,800
It serves patients

1001
00:41:58,800 --> 00:41:59,840
from the local area.

1002
00:41:59,840 --> 00:42:01,000
That's the line, right?

1003
00:42:01,000 --> 00:42:02,920
The patient base is very stable.

1004
00:42:02,920 --> 00:42:04,030
No, you...

1005
00:42:04,030 --> 00:42:05,550
It's a group of people
who don't have access

1006
00:42:05,550 --> 00:42:07,360
to quality medical resources.

1007
00:42:07,550 --> 00:42:10,360
Long Dongdong
has a deep understanding of this issue.

1008
00:42:10,360 --> 00:42:13,110
For years, he's running around
to serve the public.

1009
00:42:13,110 --> 00:42:14,280
Every Wednesday and Friday,

1010
00:42:14,280 --> 00:42:16,230
he holds free clinics in the community

1011
00:42:16,230 --> 00:42:17,630
without charging a cent.

1012
00:42:17,640 --> 00:42:19,360
That's why he understands what patients

1013
00:42:19,360 --> 00:42:21,190
like Wang Zongqi are thinking.

1014
00:42:21,570 --> 00:42:23,230
He's a doctor who isn't driven

1015
00:42:23,280 --> 00:42:24,920
by fame or money.

1016
00:42:25,880 --> 00:42:27,810
He's a role model worth following.

1017
00:42:30,000 --> 00:42:31,960
That's a pretty good press release.

1018
00:42:31,960 --> 00:42:33,000
Well, about this...

1019
00:42:33,000 --> 00:42:34,190
I didn't write it.

1020
00:42:34,190 --> 00:42:35,550
But it's all true.

1021
00:42:37,800 --> 00:42:38,600
I believe you.

1022
00:42:39,550 --> 00:42:41,360
Thanks for clearing that up for me.

1023
00:42:41,360 --> 00:42:42,190
No, wait...

1024
00:42:42,190 --> 00:42:43,320
I mean, Dr. Liu...

1025
00:42:43,630 --> 00:42:44,960
Dr. Liu?

1026
00:42:48,550 --> 00:42:49,750
Finished washing up?

1027
00:42:57,400 --> 00:42:58,280
Jiang!

1028
00:42:58,280 --> 00:42:59,070
How could you drop the ball

1029
00:42:59,070 --> 00:42:59,920
at such a crucial moment?

1030
00:42:59,920 --> 00:43:01,880
What do you mean, I dropped the ball?

1031
00:43:01,880 --> 00:43:02,880
What the heck did you write?

1032
00:43:02,880 --> 00:43:03,230
It's so hard!

1033
00:43:03,230 --> 00:43:04,400
H-how am I supposed to memorize all this?

1034
00:43:04,400 --> 00:43:05,000
Is it hard?

1035
00:43:05,000 --> 00:43:06,320
You can't even memorize these few words?

1036
00:43:06,320 --> 00:43:07,030
You're useless at everything!

1037
00:43:07,030 --> 00:43:08,030
You never do anything right!

1038
00:43:08,030 --> 00:43:09,190
You're good for nothing!

1039
00:43:09,190 --> 00:43:10,920
You're the one who's good for nothing!

1040
00:43:10,920 --> 00:43:11,920
It's only a few words?

1041
00:43:11,920 --> 00:43:13,510
Are you messing with me or what?
